# Line endings.
#
# Source and configuration files are always stored and checked out with LF so
# that `cargo fmt` (rustfmt.toml: newline_style = "Unix") and prettier
# (.prettierrc: endOfLine = "lf") pass on every platform. GitHub's Windows
# runners default to `core.autocrlf=true`, which would otherwise check these
# files out as CRLF and fail the format checks.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
